# Node >=20 races IPv6/IPv4 with a 250ms per-attempt timeout ("Happy Eyeballs").
# On high-latency links the IPv4 handshake to Neon (us-east-1) takes ~280ms, so every
# attempt is cancelled and pg/drizzle-kit time out while libpq clients connect fine.
node-options=--network-family-autoselection-attempt-timeout=1000
